{
  "id": "1-7",
  "chapter": 1,
  "order": 7,
  "kind": "practice",
  "title": "顿悟时刻：往回跳就是循环（1 + 2 + … + n）",
  "mode": "online",
  "allowLocalFile": true,
  "language": "asm",
  "prerequisites": ["1-6"],
  "concepts": ["loop", "backward-jump", "accumulator"],
  "goalSummary": {
    "before": "t0 中是一个非负整数 n",
    "after": "计算 1 + 2 + ... + n，存入 t1（n = 0 时 t1 = 0）"
  },
  "briefing": [
    {
      "tag": "核心发现",
      "text": "上一关你用跳转「往前跳」来跳过分支——那如果让跳转指令**往回跳**呢？"
    },
    {
      "tag": "循环诞生",
      "text": "往回跳，就是**循环**！配一个计数器和一个累加器，几行指令就能把重复动作执行任意多次。"
    },
    {
      "tag": "通关目标",
      "text": "计算 `1 + 2 + … + n`（`n` 在 `t0` 中），将总和存入 `t1`。别忘了考虑 `n = 0` 的边界情况！"
    }
  ],
  "sandbox": {
    "type": "manual-cpu",
    "modules": ["regs", "pcTrack"],
    "recordToAsm": true,
    "focusRegs": ["t0", "t1", "t2", "zero"],
    "regRoles": {
      "t0": "上限 n",
      "t1": "累加和",
      "t2": "计数器 i",
      "zero": "恒为 0"
    },
    "pcTrack": {
      "cases": [
        {
          "label": "n = 3（走 3 圈回跳，累加出 6）",
          "initial": { "regs": { "t0": 3, "t1": 0, "t2": 0, "zero": 0 } },
          "goal": { "regs": { "t1": 6 } }
        },
        {
          "label": "n = 0（直接跳出空循环，结果为 0）",
          "initial": { "regs": { "t0": 0, "t1": 0, "t2": 0, "zero": 0 } },
          "goal": { "regs": { "t1": 0 } }
        }
      ],
      "program": [
        { "op": "addi", "dst": "t1", "src": "zero", "imm": 0, "asm": "addi t1, zero, 0" },
        { "op": "addi", "dst": "t2", "src": "zero", "imm": 1, "asm": "addi t2, zero, 1" },
        { "label": "loop", "op": "blt", "a": "t0", "b": "t2", "target": "done", "asm": "blt t0, t2, done" },
        { "op": "add", "dst": "t1", "a": "t1", "b": "t2", "asm": "add t1, t1, t2" },
        { "op": "addi", "dst": "t2", "src": "t2", "imm": 1, "asm": "addi t2, t2, 1" },
        { "op": "j", "target": "loop", "asm": "j loop" },
        { "label": "done", "op": "halt", "asm": "ecall" }
      ]
    },
    "warmupPuzzle": {
      "prompt": "本关没有引入任何新指令！把标签贴在上方、用 j loop 往回跳，亲手走完 n = 3 的 3 圈累加。",
      "initial": {
        "regs": { "t0": 3, "t1": 0, "t2": 0, "zero": 0 }
      },
      "goal": {
        "regs": { "t1": 6 }
      }
    }
  },
  "editor": {
    "readonlyPrefix": 1,
    "readonlySuffix": 1
  },
  "hints": [
    { "level": 1, "type": "diagram", "content": "CPU 没有专门的 while/for 指令：只要在循环顶部放一个 loop: 标签，循环末尾写 j loop 往回跳，并在顶部用 blt t0, t2, done 检查是否超过 n。" },
    { "level": 2, "type": "steps", "content": "1. 初始化 t1 = 0（累加和）、t2 = 1（当前数）；2. loop: 若 t0 < t2 跳到 done；3. t1 = t1 + t2；4. t2 = t2 + 1；5. j loop；6. done:。" },
    { "level": 3, "type": "snippet", "content": "addi t1, zero, 0\naddi t2, zero, 1\nloop:\nblt  t0, t2, done\nadd  t1, t1, t2\naddi t2, t2, 1\nj    loop\ndone:" }
  ],
  "wikiRefs": ["rv32-branch", "rv32-arithmetic"]
}
